/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 51 0 R
/E (The Vividora knew this, or behaved as if it did. The mint-and-lemon water in the lobby was not a refreshment. It was a limbic event. Before I had registered the design or assessed the space or formed any opinion whatsoever, my body had already received a message: you are safe, you are somewhere considered, you have arrived. Everything that followed was experienced through that filter.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
