/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (What the Vividora adds is the inverse. Where Case Study No. 02 showed a self arriving into an environment and shaping how the environment was experienced, the Vividora shows an environment constructing a self. Not through pressure or performance, but through sensory design so layered and specific that by the time I reached the front desk, I was already a different version of myself than the one who had walked in from the street.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
