/P 53 0 R
/E (Which means the luxury consumer is not primarily chasing status, however much the industry has built itself on that assumption. They are chasing a specific kind of relief. The relief of being in a space that has thought about them. That is a very different brief.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
