/P 54 0 R
/E (The Vividora is a hotel. But this case study is not about hospitality. It is about the mechanism by which any luxury environment constructs a felt experience in the body of the consumer before any rational evaluation has begun. That mechanism operates identically in a flagship store, a showroom, a private dining room, a beauty counter, a fitting room.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
